Program interface:
Return Python source defining a top-level Solution class inheriting rsikit.Policy.
Inherit Policy.__init__; do not define an __init__ method. The executor supplies
the environment's observation/action spaces and static instructions. Read them
through self.observation_space, self.action_space, and self.instructions. Do not
generate, replace, or assign these instructions.
Implement async act(self, observation) returning a valid action. Initialize and
clear policy-owned state in async reset(self, *, seed=None), calling
await super().reset(seed=seed) first. Optional async close(self) releases resources.
The policy cannot access the environment or its reward calculation. Its state
persists for one episode. No network or host files. Do not add an executable main block.

